fn gui_rgba8888_row_tile_plan_from_range %fn &GuiRgba8888RowBatchRange fn i32 fn i32 Result GuiRgba8888RowTilePlan GuiRgba8888RowTilePlanPrepareErrorKind \range\tile_rows\storage_byte_count:
